{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"mba-title","type":"text","text":"# OddsWell multi-brain architecture\nBrains propose or estimate. Authoritative engines validate, resolve, lock, and settle.\n[[Design/Decisions/DEC-003 Multi-Brain AI Architecture|Core architecture]] • [[Design/Decisions/DEC-016 Basketball Odds and Wager Isolation|Basketball wager firewall]]","x":-700,"y":-770,"width":1400,"height":170,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"mba-context","type":"text","text":"## 🧠 1. Shared context\n**Project brain:** approved design and policy\n**Athlete Life:** stress, discipline, recovery, relationships\n**World + League:** schedules, teams, careers, history","x":-650,"y":-570,"width":570,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"mba-sport-ai","type":"text","text":"## 🏀 2. Basketball AI\nReceives a sports-only snapshot.\n\nChooses one action from a legal list. Invalid or unavailable output uses a deterministic fallback.","x":80,"y":-570,"width":570,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"mba-engine","type":"text","text":"## ⚙️ 3. Authority engine\nValidates actions, applies ratings + state, and resolves the seeded result.\n\n**Active:** v2 shooting consistency + v1 baseline opportunity\n**Scope:** OPPORTUNITY ONLY\n**Firewall:** credits, purchases, and wagers never influence outcomes.","x":-650,"y":-260,"width":570,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"mba-learning","type":"text","text":"## 📚 4. Controlled learning\nStores context, choices, results, failures, cost, and latency.\n\nCandidate prompts, policies, fine-tunes, or models are evaluated offline. Only an approved named version returns to play.","x":80,"y":-260,"width":570,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"mba-replay","type":"text","text":"## 🎞️ Permanent replay record\nPolicy + decisions + seed + event log\nConsistency + involvement versions and frozen roster snapshots\n\nReplay uses stored evidence; it never invents the past.","x":-650,"y":80,"width":570,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"mba-future-sports","type":"text","text":"## ⚽ 🏈 ⚾ New sport = new brain\nReuse project, athlete-life, world, authority, audit, and learning layers.\n\nAdd a sport-specific action policy and rules engine.","x":80,"y":60,"width":570,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"mba-odds","type":"text","text":"## 📊 5. Basketball Odds Brain — OFFER CONTRACT ACTIVE\n`basketball-match-winner-odds-v1` verifies one frozen public pregame commitment.\n\nFair integer odds • 10–100 Odds Bucks • no hidden/future/private-life state • cannot affect the game. Props remain later gates.","x":-650,"y":330,"width":570,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"mba-wager","type":"text","text":"## 🔒 6. Wager engine — EXACT LOSS FINALIZED\nRequest/debit ✓ • lock ✓ • Game 1 result ✓ • decision ✓\nHarbor selected vs Mesa winner → SETTLED LOST\nGross applied 0 • ledger 2 • balance 60\n\nNo payout, refund, correction, UI, or basketball control path.","x":80,"y":330,"width":570,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"mba-admin","type":"text","text":"## 👁️ 7. READ-ONLY EXACT-LOSS HISTORY ✓\nValidates the whole server chain before display:\noffer → request/debit → lock → sealed result → decision → finalization\n\nHarbor selected • Mesa won • stake 40 • return 0 • net -40 • balance 60 • SETTLED LOST\nExact replay + command links • missing/invalid = unavailable • NO CONTROLS","x":-300,"y":650,"width":600,"height":230,"color":"3"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"mba-edge-1","fromNode":"mba-context","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mba-sport-ai","toSide":"left"},
		{"id":"mba-edge-2","fromNode":"mba-sport-ai","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mba-engine","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"mba-edge-3","fromNode":"mba-engine","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mba-learning","toSide":"left"},
		{"id":"mba-edge-4","fromNode":"mba-engine","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mba-replay","toSide":"top"},
		{"id":"mba-edge-5","fromNode":"mba-odds","fromSide":"right","toNode":"mba-wager","toSide":"left"},
		{"id":"mba-edge-6","fromNode":"mba-replay","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mba-wager","toSide":"top","label":"sealed result only"},
		{"id":"mba-edge-7","fromNode":"mba-wager","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"mba-admin","toSide":"top","label":"audit evidence"}
	]
}
